---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-ink/10 bg-porcelain-2">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
		<div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Cherry Creek Dermatology</p>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-ink-soft">
					Medical and surgical dermatology in Cherry Creek North, focused on skin cancer screening
					and sun health for Denver&rsquo;s mile-high UV exposure &mdash; open since 2026.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint">Visit</p>
				<p>250 Steele Street, Suite 100</p>
				<p>Cherry Creek North, Denver, CO 80206</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="tel:+13035550148" class="hover:text-clinical-blue">(303) 555-0148</a>
				</p>
				<p><a href="mailto:hello@cherrycreekderm.com" class="hover:text-clinical-blue">hello@cherrycreekderm.com</a></p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint">Hours</p>
				<p>Mon&ndash;Thu &nbsp; 7:30a &ndash; 4:30p</p>
				<p>Fri &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7:30a &ndash; 12:00p</p>
				<p class="mt-3 text-ink-faint">Most insurance plans accepted for medical visits.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mm-scale my-8"></div>

		<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-ink-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
			<p>&copy; {year} Cherry Creek Dermatology, PC</p>
			<p>Concept site by Noel Ngerem &middot; not a real business</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
